  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes QNNformer, a hybrid Transformer plus quantum neural network model for multivariate long-term forecasting, evaluated on five benchmark datasets: Weather, Traffic, Electricity, ETTh2, and ETTm2. It reports best-case errors such as Weather 96-step MSE/MAE of 0.170/0.210 and Electricity 96-step MSE/MAE of 0.112/0.205, using 4-6 qubits on the Qiskit Aer simulator with Grover diffusion and QAOA components. The paper also includes ablations showing incremental gains from Grover and QAOA, but no real-hardware quantum advantage is demonstrated.",
